# Feature scope — only these product areas

Unless the user **explicitly** expands scope, only work on these features:

| Feature | Nav / area |
|---------|------------|
| Search | `search` |
| Home | `home` |
| Anime | `anime` |
| Asian Drama | `asian_drama` (KissKh) |
| IPTV | `iptv` |
| Live Matches | `live_matches` |
| Lists | `mylist` / lists |
| Settings | `settings` |

Plus shared playback/shell that those tabs use (player, sources used by Home/Search/Anime/Asian Drama, stream providers, WebStreamr when it feeds those surfaces).

## Out of scope — do not touch unless asked

- Arabic / Anime Arabic tabs and extractors (`arabic`, `anime_arabic`, Larozaa, DimaToon, Brstej, …)
- Amri
- Books, music, comics, manga, audiobooks
- Jellyfin, downloader, magnet (unless user asks)
- Any other nav tab not listed above

## Remote provider config (RFC-039)

Do **not** seed or wire out-of-scope hosts (Arabic, Amri, …) into `provider_runtime_config`. Stick to in-scope stream/anime/Asian Drama/WebStreamr bases.

## TV

TV polish still follows [forja-tv-scope.mdc](./forja-tv-scope.mdc) (same in-scope tab set).
